# ROVEXO v1.0 — Single Preview Link + SSOT (OWNER APPROVED · LOCKED)

## Canonical architecture

ONE FEATURE → ONE COMPONENT → ONE ROUTE → ONE OWNER URL → ONE OWNER REVIEW → ONE CERTIFIED VERSION → ONE DEPLOYMENT

Forbidden: duplicate pages/components/cards, temporary pages, parallel/legacy/backup/experimental UI versions.

## Official Owner URL (Policy v3.0)

**https://www.rovexo.co.uk** + path below.

One permanent domain. All modules. Never localhost or module-specific preview URLs for Owner approval. See `owner-preview-policy-v3.mdc`.

