## Forbidden temporary previews

Never create or serve: `empty.html`, `products.html`, `profile.html`, `favourites.html`, `preview.html`, `test-preview.html`, `v2-preview.html`, `localhost:8768` (or any alternate preview port), duplicated preview environments.

All Owner reviews use **official application routes only** on **https://www.rovexo.co.uk**.

## Visibility gate

Do **not** claim Owner-reviewable until the change is visible on `https://www.rovexo.co.uk/<path>` (and Owner can open it on mobile). Agent may use `localhost:3000` for development only.

## Workflow (mandatory order)

IMPLEMENT → SAVE → BUILD → TYPECHECK → ESLINT → TESTS → HOT RELOAD → DEPLOY TO OFFICIAL OWNER URL → OWNER REVIEW → OWNER APPROVED → FREEZE → CERTIFICATION → GIT COMMIT → GITHUB PUSH (as Owner authorizes)

Never skip. Never commit/push/deploy before Owner approval for the stage.

## Product Card SSOT

Only `ListingCard.tsx`. Used by Homepage, Search, Categories, Favourites, Seller, Stores, Recently viewed, Similar, Recommended, Related, Browse. Never create parallel `*Card.tsx` product cards.

Mandatory fields always visible (including new products ★ 0.0 / 👁 0): image, favourite, price, incl., title, condition, rating, views, click → product page.

## Profile / Favourites

- Profile: `/account` — back, PROFILE, avatar, username, View profile, rating, coloured icons, black chevrons (except Sign Out). Social Follow permanently removed.
- Favourites: `/saved` — empty state or 2-col `ListingCard` grid only.
